<section class="pf-demo not-prose" data-pf-demo>
  <div class="pf-head">
    <div>
      <span class="pf-kicker">PATHFINDING LAB</span>
      <h3>寻路算法可视化实验</h3>
      <p>编辑网格、切换算法并观察搜索波前。动画只更新发生变化的格子，不再反复重建整个网格。</p>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="pf-run" data-run>
      <span data-run-icon>▶</span>
      <span data-run-text>运行搜索</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="pf-algos" data-algos>
    <button data-algo="bfs" class="is-active">BFS</button>
    <button data-algo="dfs">DFS</button>
    <button data-algo="greedy">Greedy</button>
    <button data-algo="dijkstra">Dijkstra</button>
    <button data-algo="astar">A*</button>
    <button data-algo="bibfs">Bi-BFS</button>
    <button data-algo="floyd">Floyd</button>
    <button data-algo="bellman">Bellman-Ford</button>
  </div>

  <div class="pf-toolbar">
    <div class="pf-tool-group">
      <button data-tool="start" class="is-active">起点 S</button>
      <button data-tool="end">终点 E</button>
      <button data-tool="wall">障碍</button>
      <button data-tool="up">权重 +</button>
      <button data-tool="down">权重 −</button>
    </div>

    <div class="pf-tool-group pf-tool-group--right">
      <button data-clear>清除搜索</button>
      <button data-reset>完全重置</button>
      <label class="pf-speed">
        <span>动画速度</span>
        <input type="range" min="10" max="180" value="55" data-speed />
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pf-main">
    <div class="pf-board-card">
      <div class="pf-board-top">
        <span data-board-status>READY</span>
        <span>12 × 12 Grid</span>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-board" data-board aria-label="寻路算法交互网格"></div>

      <div class="pf-legend">
        <span><i class="start"></i>起点</span>
        <span><i class="end"></i>终点</span>
        <span><i class="current"></i>当前节点</span>
        <span><i class="frontier"></i>Frontier</span>
        <span><i class="visited"></i>Visited</span>
        <span><i class="path"></i>Path</span>
        <span><i class="wall"></i>障碍</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="pf-info">
      <div class="pf-info-head">
        <span class="pf-algo-dot"></span>
        <h4 data-title>BFS · 广度优先搜索</h4>
      </div>

      <p data-explain>队列逐层扩散。在无权网格中，第一次到达终点时得到最少步数路径。</p>

      <div class="pf-formula" data-formula>优先级：层数 / FIFO</div>

      <div class="pf-metrics">
        <div>
          <span>状态</span>
          <strong data-state>等待运行</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>访问节点</span>
          <strong data-visited>0</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>循环步数</span>
          <strong data-steps>0</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>路径长度</span>
          <strong data-length>—</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>总代价</span>
          <strong data-cost>—</strong>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-tip" data-tip>
        先切换到“终点 E”放置终点，再用障碍工具拖动画墙。
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
